{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Pirate's Gambit</strong>, you step into the eerie gamble left behind by Captain Kidd. To survive, you must <strong>build</strong> your deck wisely, master the dice and items, and make each move count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532360/extras/GamePlay_1online-video-cutter.com-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1740085381\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532360/extras/Shop.gif?t=1740085381\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As new routes unfold, you will traverse uncharted lands, from scorching volcanoes to frozen wastelands and beyond as you gradually uncover the ship\u2019s long-buried secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532360/extras/Sail.gif?t=1740085381\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But something lurks in the shadows. Are you the one controlling the dice, or merely a pawn in their game?\u00a0In this gamble with no way back, the only certainty is that every roll could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532360/extras/Flash_Cut.gif?t=1740085381\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3532360?t=1740085381","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3532360?t=1740085381","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532360/a490035d332f0b37c725d8f52cd0c61ffc7ad514/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740085381","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532360/a490035d332f0b37c725d8f52cd0c61ffc7ad514/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740085381","categories":[{"descri